Backport of two PRs that fix data corruption when writing sharded arrays concurrently
with dask.
Issue: https://github.com/zarr-developers/zarr-python/issues/3514
PRs in dask: https://github.com/dask/dask/pull/12105
	     https://github.com/dask/dask/pull/12106
Fixed in dask version 2025.11.0
Author: Jarne Renders (Vrije Universiteit Brussel)
